          Aedan Cullen's{" "}
          <a href="https://media.ccc.de/v/38c3-hacking-the-rp2350" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={link}>38C3 talk</a>{" "}
          annotation. Photo:{" "}
          <a href="https://github.com/aedancullen/hacking-the-rp2350" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={link}>Aedan Cullen</a>,{" "}
